Fix running the admin container with a PostgreSQL database. It failed to start (`ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'psycopg'`) because SQLAlchemy 2.1 selects psycopg 3 for `postgresql://` URIs, so the image now ships psycopg 3 instead of psycopg2. The shared spam and quarantine settings could not be saved (`value too long for type character varying(255)`), so the `config.value` column is no longer limited to 255 characters.
